## Desired behavior

AFT should be able to answer:
- what this file imports;
- what imports this file;
- transitive dependents up to a bounded depth;
- whether a file is likely load-bearing based on fan-in/fan-out and transitive dependent count.

These facts should enrich read/edit/write advisories.

## Scope

In scope:
