## Documentation gap

Future contributors need to understand that:
- trigram index accelerates lexical search;
- semantic index supports embeddings;
- repo-intelligence graph stores symbols/imports/refs/metrics;
- graph facts are used behind existing tools, not exposed as a large new tool surface.

